!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Live CD8+ T cells were isolated by FACS and subjected to ATAC-seq
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Omni ATAC-seq was performed as previously described (Corces et al Nature Methods 2017)
!Sample_data_processing = Reads were trimmed and quality filtered using fastp.
